wyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-06-22T15:52:06Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:35:08Z","closed_at":"2025-07-03T18:12:53Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107857","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107857","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107857.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107857.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Currently, properties using `PROPERTY_HINT_GROUP_ENABLE` for inspector sections do not update their visual state (checkbox and folding) immediately when changed by external scripts (e.g., `@tool` scripts). This is because these properties do not create an EditorProperty instance, thus bypassing the standard update mechanism based on `editor_property_map`.\r\n\r\nThis commit introduces a new `_toggle_sections` HashMap in `EditorInspector` to specifically track and update these sections. When a property change is requested or during auto-refresh, if the property is a section toggle, its associated `EditorInspectorSection` will now be updated directly.\r\n\r\nFixes: #107826 ","closed_by":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/st